==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] to stall as you slowly upgrade your [[Worker Cat]]. When Those Guys come, fire your [[Cat Cannon]]. Spawn [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] and keep spamming meatshields.

