==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Kochi Prefecture'''.
*Kochi Prefecture's base is one of the famous [https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g298234-d1383711-Reviews-Ryoma_Sakamoto_Bronze_Statue-Kochi_Kochi_Prefecture_Shikoku.html bronze statues] of [[wikipedia:Sakamoto Ryōma|Sakamoto Ryōma]], a politician and samurai. The fish in his hand is a [[wikipedia:Skipjack tuna|skipjack tuna]], used in Kōchi's signature [[wikipedia:Tataki|''tataki'']].

